19. Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 13 Year 2006 concerning Guidelines for Regional Financial Management, as amended several times, most recently by Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 21 Year 2011 concerning Second Amendment to Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 13 Year 2006 concerning Guidelines for Regional Financial Management;  
20. Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 1 Year 2014 concerning the Formulation of Regional Legal Products;  
21. Regional Regulation of Tapin Regency Number 04 Year 2008 concerning Regional Government Affairs of Tapin Regency;  
